{"id":"vod_sn_37579","vodId":"37579","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"皇家国教骑士团","name_cn":"皇家国教骑士团","date":"2001-01-01","year":"2001","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/fbb0c0d5a9e760e5191e7bf095f2ca0b.jpg"},"summary":"在英国某个村庄，吸血鬼和食尸鬼横行霸道，祸害人间。旨在消灭反基督怪物的皇家国教骑士团（Hellsing）派出强大、恐怖的吸血鬼杀手阿尔卡特，阿尔卡特打败邪物，也间接将倒霉的女警察西洛斯·维多利亚变成吸血鬼，进而成为Hellsing的一员。此后不久，Hellsing总部遭到近乎毁灭性的入侵，随着各种离奇事件层出不穷，一个名为“千禧年”的邪恶组织慢慢浮出水面。他们全由纳粹战败军官组成，为了一雪二战之耻，这群战争狂人不惜制造一支吸血鬼军团。搅合了多方势力的正邪大战就此拉开序幕……　　本片根据平野耕太同名漫画改编，系该作品的TV版，后被制作成OV重新发行。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:53:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/p4n9xk765E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cF8chXJ9n01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/JF160Er04r1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rzHnujr6AY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dRYHwae7NS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DUJUVyejNi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qwdA0KMham1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nW1bWa5Hjx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Hk1bgDXQFT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sw9YSbdhW21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SZDt5qi80h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3L1z1Gs7zd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R2fgg7X03s1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:09.244Z"}